<title>USA: Strouds names Kmart exec as CEO.</title>
<headline>Strouds names Kmart exec as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>CITY OF INDUSTRY, Calif. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strouds Inc, a specialty retailer of home products, said Tuesday it had named Charles Chinni as chief executive officer, replacing Wayne Selness, who resigned in April.</p>
<p>Chinni will also join Strouds's board of directors.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Strouds, Chinni was executive vice president of merchandising with Kmart Corp.</p>
